---
source: tests/tui_render.rs
expression: terminal.backend().to_string()
---
"┌ Favor┌Keys──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐──────┐"
"│* adds│Tab / Shift-Tab          Next pane / previous pane                        │      │"
"└──────│Enter                    Open the folder or message, fold a date group    │      │"
"┌ Unrea│→ ←  l h                 Unfold or fold a folder or group, next/prev mail │      │"
"│No unr│*                        Add the folder to Favorites or take it out       │      │"
"└──────│↑ ↓  j k                 Move, or scroll the message                      │      │"
"┏ Folde│PgUp PgDn Ctrl-B Ctrl-F  Move or scroll a page                            │      │"
"┃>   In│Ctrl-U Ctrl-D            Move or scroll half a page                       │      │"
"┃    Se│g g  G  Home End         Jump to the first or last                        │      │"
"┃    Pr│z                        Zoom the pane, or show every pane again          │      │"
"┃      │b                        Hide or show the folders                         │      │"
"┃      │Space, Ctrl-A            Mark a message, mark them all (Esc clears)       │      │"
"┃      │d                        Move marked, selected or folder to Deleted Items │      │"
"┃      │D                        Delete marked, selected or folder for good       │      │"
"┃      │c  r  R  f               Write a message, reply, reply to all, forward    │      │"
"┃      │F5  Ctrl-R               Sync every folder now                            │      │"
"┃      │/                        Search every folder (Esc goes back)              │      │"
"┃      │S                        Write this account's signature                   │      │"
"┗━━━━━━│?                        Show this help                                   │──────┘"
" ? help└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘q quit "
